<title>GREECE: OTE telecom sees 17.8pct earnings growth in 96.</title>
<headline>OTE telecom sees 17.8pct earnings growth in 96.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greek telecom company OTE sees pretax earnings growth of 17.8 percent in 1996 with pretax profit expected to reach 240 billion drachmas from 203.7 billion in 1995, officials told Reuters.</p>
<p>Based on its IPO prospectus, the telecom had projected pretax earnings of 259 billion drachmas this year, equity analysts said.</p>
<p>Sales in 1996 will grow 26.4 percent to 750 billion drachmas from 593 billion a year earlier. They will exceed a projected 700 billion drachmas in the IPO prospectus.</p>
</text>
